#. module: aic_theme
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_aic_theme
msgid ""
"\n"
"Backend Theme Engine\n"
"===================\n"
"A calm, white restyling of the whole Odoo 20 backend: buttons, inputs, dropdowns, dialogs,\n"
"notifications, navbar, home menu (Enterprise), control panel, search, form / list / kanban /\n"
"calendar / graph / pivot views, settings, and the Enterprise gantt / grid / cohort / map /\n"
"hierarchy views.\n"
"\n"
"* White panels on a white ground, separated by soft layered shadows; seated wells for inputs.\n"
"* One action colour, one \"you are here\" highlight and one ink: the theme's tangerine, butter and\n"
"  plum by default, or taken from the company logo, or chosen by hand, per company.\n"
"* Every colour is adjusted until its text passes WCAG AA, in light and in dark mode.\n"
"* Performance oriented: SCSS compiled by Odoo's own asset pipeline; a company palette is a few\n"
"  CSS variables in the page head. No extra RPC.\n"
"* Enable / disable at any time from *Settings → General Settings → Backend theme* without\n"
"  uninstalling. Works with Community and Enterprise; no dependency on ``web_enterprise``.\n"
msgstr ""

